WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.829
A Canadian Forces signals operator from Afghanistan spent two years building this.

00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:05.863
Not for money.

00:00:05.863 --> 00:00:06.988
Not for fame.

00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:11.204
Because seventy-six thousand dead people deserve someone giving a damn.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:16.397
This is the government's data, organized so you can finally see what they've been hiding in plain sight.
